1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,553
500 rupaye mahine ki SIP se sach mein kuch banta hai?

2
00:00:03,553 --> 00:00:06,136
Yahi sawaal Bhai ne pichhle hafte mujhse poocha.

3
00:00:06,136 --> 00:00:08,720
Uske phone par SIP ka app khula tha.

4
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:12,272
Screen par paisa wahin ka wahin tha. Aur usne kaha, bhaiya,

5
00:00:12,272 --> 00:00:14,210
main ise band kar raha hoon.

6
00:00:14,210 --> 00:00:17,395
Bhai ne yeh SIP June 2024 mein shuru ki thi.

7
00:00:17,395 --> 00:00:20,898
Har mahine 500 rupaye, bank se apne aap kat jaate the.

8
00:00:20,898 --> 00:00:23,446
Usne socha tha, chhota amount hai, chubhega nahi.

9
00:00:23,446 --> 00:00:26,949
Aur dheere dheere kuch bada ban jaayega. Sab yahi sochte hain,

10
00:00:26,949 --> 00:00:28,860
aur yeh soch galat nahi hai.

11
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:32,553
Dinner par Papa ne FD ki rasidein nikaal li. Bole,

12
00:00:32,553 --> 00:00:35,137
maine kaha tha na, FD safe hai.

13
00:00:35,137 --> 00:00:37,353
Share market mein paisa doobta hai.

14
00:00:37,353 --> 00:00:39,938
Mummy chai lekar chupchaap sun rahi thi.

15
00:00:39,938 --> 00:00:43,630
Unke chehre par wahi purani chinta thi, paisa gaya toh?

16
00:00:43,630 --> 00:00:47,023
Behen ne phone se nazar uthayi aur seedha sawaal kiya. Bhai,

17
00:00:47,023 --> 00:00:49,490
tumhe pata bhi hai SIP hoti kya hai?

18
00:00:49,490 --> 00:00:52,574
Ya bas kisi video mein suna aur shuru kar di?

19
00:00:52,574 --> 00:00:54,733
Bhai chup ho gaya. Sach yeh hai,

20
00:00:54,733 --> 00:00:57,200
zyaadatar log bina samjhe SIP shuru karte hain.

21
00:00:57,200 --> 00:00:57,897
Toh chaliye,

22
00:00:57,897 --> 00:01:01,384
usi dinner table ki baat aaj aapke saath karte hain.

23
00:01:01,384 --> 00:01:03,127
Aaj teen sawaal hain. Pehla,

24
00:01:03,127 --> 00:01:06,963
500 rupaye ki SIP asal mein kaam kaise karti hai? Phir,

25
00:01:06,963 --> 00:01:10,798
market seedha na chale toh kya hota hai? Aur aakhir mein,

26
00:01:10,798 --> 00:01:12,890
chupchaap aapka paisa kaun khata hai?

27
00:01:12,890 --> 00:01:15,480
Pehle seedhi baat, SIP hoti kya hai.

28
00:01:15,480 --> 00:01:19,550
SIP yaani Systematic Investment Plan. Matlab har mahine fixed taarikh par,

29
00:01:19,550 --> 00:01:22,140
fixed rakam mutual fund mein jaati hai.

30
00:01:22,140 --> 00:01:25,840
Mutual fund yaani bahut saare logon ka paisa ek jagah.

31
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:29,540
Use professional fund manager shares ya bonds mein lagata hai.

32
00:01:29,540 --> 00:01:33,471
Aur sabse achhi baat, shuruaat badi rakam se nahi karni padti.

33
00:01:33,471 --> 00:01:38,117
AMFI ke mutabik SIP 500 rupaye mahine se bhi shuru ho sakti hai.

34
00:01:38,117 --> 00:01:41,334
Yaani mahine ka bahar ka pizza chhod do, bas.

35
00:01:41,334 --> 00:01:44,550
Ameer hona zaroori nahi hai, shuru karna zaroori hai.

36
00:01:44,550 --> 00:01:47,994
Lekin yahin log pehli galti karte hain. Woh sochte hain,

37
00:01:47,994 --> 00:01:51,437
SIP koi scheme hai jo fixed return deti hai. Nahi.

38
00:01:51,437 --> 00:01:53,848
SIP sirf paisa daalne ka tareeka hai.

39
00:01:53,848 --> 00:01:57,292
Return us fund se aata hai jisme paisa jaata hai.

40
00:01:57,292 --> 00:02:01,080
Aur fund ka return market ke saath upar neeche hota hai.

41
00:02:01,080 --> 00:02:05,349
Ab pehla sawaal, yeh 500 rupaye kaam kaise karte hain?

42
00:02:05,349 --> 00:02:10,045
Iske liye ek bhaari shabd hai, rupee cost averaging. Ghabraiye mat,

43
00:02:10,045 --> 00:02:12,180
iska matlab bahut simple hai.

44
00:02:12,180 --> 00:02:15,168
Chaliye ise sabzi mandi mein samajhte hain,

45
00:02:15,168 --> 00:02:17,730
jahan Wife har hafte jaati hai.

46
00:02:17,730 --> 00:02:19,413
Maan lijiye tamatar sasta hai,

47
00:02:19,413 --> 00:02:23,115
toh usi paise mein zyaada kilo aate hain. Tamatar mehnga hai,

48
00:02:23,115 --> 00:02:24,462
toh kam aate hain.

49
00:02:24,462 --> 00:02:27,828
Agar aap har hafte utne hi paise ke tamatar lo,

50
00:02:27,828 --> 00:02:30,520
toh kya hoga? Kabhi zyaada milenge, kabhi kam.

51
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:32,540
Average daam beech ka ho jaayega.

52
00:02:32,540 --> 00:02:34,677
Mutual fund mein bhi yahi hota hai.

53
00:02:34,677 --> 00:02:37,731
Fund ka daam roz badalta hai, ise NAV kehte hain.

54
00:02:37,731 --> 00:02:41,090
NAV yaani fund ki ek unit ka us din ka daam.

55
00:02:41,090 --> 00:02:43,533
Aapke 500 rupaye se jitni units aati hain,

56
00:02:43,533 --> 00:02:45,670
utni aapke account mein jud jaati hain.

57
00:02:45,670 --> 00:02:48,012
Jab market upar hai, NAV mehngi hai,

58
00:02:48,012 --> 00:02:51,022
toh units kam milti hain. Jab market neeche hai,

59
00:02:51,022 --> 00:02:53,699
NAV sasti hai, toh units zyaada milti hain.

60
00:02:53,699 --> 00:02:57,044
Aapko kuch karna nahi padta. Bank se paisa kat-ta hai,

61
00:02:57,044 --> 00:02:59,720
aur system apne aap average kar deta hai.

62
00:02:59,720 --> 00:03:01,450
Ab Bhai ki galti dekhiye.

63
00:03:01,450 --> 00:03:04,910
Usne sirf screen par total value dekhi. Value badhi nahi,

64
00:03:04,910 --> 00:03:06,986
toh usne socha nuksaan ho gaya.

65
00:03:06,986 --> 00:03:10,792
Par usne yeh nahi dekha ki girte market mein uske 500

66
00:03:10,792 --> 00:03:12,868
rupaye zyaada units khareed rahe the.

67
00:03:12,868 --> 00:03:15,290
Wahi units aage ka asli khazana hain.

68
00:03:15,290 --> 00:03:16,240
Isliye kehte hain,

69
00:03:16,240 --> 00:03:19,406
SIP karne waale ke liye girta market dushman nahi hai.

70
00:03:19,406 --> 00:03:20,989
Woh sale ka season hai.

71
00:03:20,989 --> 00:03:24,471
Dukaan pe sale lagti hai toh hum bhaag ke jaate hain.

72
00:03:24,471 --> 00:03:28,270
Share market pe sale lagti hai toh hum bhaag ke nikalte hain.

73
00:03:28,270 --> 00:03:29,220
Ulta nahi lagta?

74
00:03:29,220 --> 00:03:31,595
Lekin ek imaandaar baat bhi sun lijiye.

75
00:03:31,595 --> 00:03:34,309
Rupee cost averaging nuksaan ko gayab nahi karti.

76
00:03:34,309 --> 00:03:37,363
Agar market bahut lambe samay tak neeche hi rahe,

77
00:03:37,363 --> 00:03:39,399
toh averaging bhi bacha nahi sakti.

78
00:03:39,399 --> 00:03:43,470
Yeh bas itna karti hai ki aapko sahi waqt dhundhna nahi padta.

79
00:03:43,470 --> 00:03:47,563
Market ka sahi waqt koi nahi jaanta. Na TV waale,

80
00:03:47,563 --> 00:03:51,656
na tip dene waale dost. Ise market timing kehte hain,

81
00:03:51,656 --> 00:03:54,931
yaani sabse neeche khareedna aur sabse upar bechna.

82
00:03:54,931 --> 00:03:57,796
Bade bade log isme fail hote hain.

83
00:03:57,796 --> 00:04:01,480
SIP aapko is game se bahar nikaal deti hai.

84
00:04:01,480 --> 00:04:02,545
Ab doosra sawaal,

85
00:04:02,545 --> 00:04:05,739
jo Bhai ko sabse zyaada pareshaan kar raha tha.

86
00:04:05,739 --> 00:04:09,642
Market seedha na chale, bas wahin ghoomta rahe, toh kya karein?

87
00:04:09,642 --> 00:04:12,127
Yeh sawaal sirf Bhai ka nahi hai.

88
00:04:12,127 --> 00:04:15,321
Bahut saare SIP waale aaj yahi soch rahe hain.

89
00:04:15,321 --> 00:04:17,450
Pehle dekhte hain ki hua kya.

90
00:04:17,450 --> 00:04:21,937
Value Research ne Nifty ke Total Return Index ka data dekha.

91
00:04:21,937 --> 00:04:26,015
Total Return yaani daam ke saath dividend bhi jod kar.

92
00:04:26,015 --> 00:04:30,502
June 2024 se June 2026 tak, isne sirf 2.2 percent diya.

93
00:04:30,502 --> 00:04:32,949
Itne lambe waqt mein, bas itna.

94
00:04:32,949 --> 00:04:36,620
Bhai ki SIP ka poora samay isi mein beeta.

95
00:04:36,620 --> 00:04:39,159
Aur 2026 mein June ke aakhir tak,

96
00:04:39,159 --> 00:04:40,973
index 8.1 percent neeche tha.

97
00:04:40,973 --> 00:04:45,326
Yaani Bhai ke shuru karne ke baad market lagbhag wahin khada raha.

98
00:04:45,326 --> 00:04:47,866
Upar se is saal aur gir gaya.

99
00:04:47,866 --> 00:04:51,493
Bhai ki screen par jo dikha, woh jhooth nahi tha.

100
00:04:51,493 --> 00:04:53,670
Market sach mein thaka hua tha.

101
00:04:53,670 --> 00:04:56,567
Aise samay ko flat ya sideways market kehte hain.

102
00:04:56,567 --> 00:04:59,463
Yaani market na upar jaata hai, na bahut neeche,

103
00:04:59,463 --> 00:05:03,003
bas idhar udhar ghoomta hai. Yeh sabse boring samay hota hai.

104
00:05:03,003 --> 00:05:06,865
Aur boring samay mein hi log sabse zyaada SIP band karte hain.

105
00:05:06,865 --> 00:05:09,440
Dimaag kehta hai, kuch ho hi nahi raha.

106
00:05:09,440 --> 00:05:11,793
Bhai ka logic bhi yahi tha. Usne kaha,

107
00:05:11,793 --> 00:05:14,735
jab kuch mil hi nahi raha, toh paisa kyun daalun?

108
00:05:14,735 --> 00:05:17,677
Isse achha FD mein daal deta hoon, Papa bhi khush.

109
00:05:17,677 --> 00:05:20,031
Sunne mein yeh logic bilkul sahi lagta hai.

110
00:05:20,031 --> 00:05:22,090
Lekin isme ek chhupi hui galti hai.

111
00:05:22,090 --> 00:05:27,110
Galti yeh hai ki flat market mein bhi aapke 500 rupaye ruke nahi hain.

112
00:05:27,110 --> 00:05:31,054
Woh units khareed rahe hain, aur girte daam par zyaada units.

113
00:05:31,054 --> 00:05:33,564
Agar aur jab market aage chalta hai,

114
00:05:33,564 --> 00:05:36,433
yahi sasti units sabse zyaada kaam aati hain.

115
00:05:36,433 --> 00:05:39,660
Band karne waale ke paas yeh hoti hi nahi.

116
00:05:39,660 --> 00:05:42,656
Ab compounding samajhiye. Compounding yaani byaaj par byaaj,

117
00:05:42,656 --> 00:05:44,154
ya return par return.

118
00:05:44,154 --> 00:05:49,398
Yeh tabhi kaam karti hai jab paisa lambe samay tak bina toote pada rahe.

119
00:05:49,398 --> 00:05:52,768
SIP band ki, toh compounding ki chain toot gayi.

120
00:05:52,768 --> 00:05:55,390
Aur toota hua samay wapas nahi aata.

121
00:05:55,390 --> 00:05:58,219
Socho ek ladka har mahine gym jaata hai,

122
00:05:58,219 --> 00:06:02,110
par body nahi banti. Kuch mahine baad woh chhod deta hai.

123
00:06:02,110 --> 00:06:04,939
Aur jis mahine se body banni shuru hoti,

124
00:06:04,939 --> 00:06:06,708
woh wahan hai hi nahi.

125
00:06:06,708 --> 00:06:10,598
SIP band karna bhi waisa hi hai. Mehnat ke din jhele,

126
00:06:10,598 --> 00:06:12,720
aur fal ke din aap gayab.

127
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:14,599
Lekin yahan bhi imaandaar baat.

128
00:06:14,599 --> 00:06:17,606
Koi nahi keh sakta ki market kab chalega.

129
00:06:17,606 --> 00:06:20,613
Ho sakta hai flat samay aur lamba chale.

130
00:06:20,613 --> 00:06:25,123
Isiliye SIP sirf us paise se karo jiski zaroorat jaldi na pade.

131
00:06:25,123 --> 00:06:28,130
Tab aapko girte market mein bechna nahi padega.

132
00:06:28,130 --> 00:06:31,832
Ab teesra sawaal. Aapke paise ko chupchaap kaun khata hai?

133
00:06:31,832 --> 00:06:34,054
Behen ne yahi poocha tha. Bhaiya,

134
00:06:34,054 --> 00:06:37,756
fund manager free mein kaam karta hai kya? Bilkul nahi.

135
00:06:37,756 --> 00:06:40,348
Uski fees ka naam hai expense ratio.

136
00:06:40,348 --> 00:06:42,940
Aur yeh fees har saal lagti hai.

137
00:06:42,940 --> 00:06:45,911
Expense ratio yaani fund chalane ka saalana kharcha.

138
00:06:45,911 --> 00:06:49,625
Fund manager ki salary, office, research, sab isme aata hai.

139
00:06:49,625 --> 00:06:52,596
Yeh aapke bill mein alag se nahi aata.

140
00:06:52,596 --> 00:06:55,939
Yeh chupchaap fund ki value se kat jaata hai.

141
00:06:55,939 --> 00:06:58,910
Isliye zyaadatar log ise kabhi dekhte hi nahi.

142
00:06:58,910 --> 00:06:59,936
Kirana dukaan socho.

143
00:06:59,936 --> 00:07:03,015
Shopkeeper har cheez par thoda sa margin rakhta hai.

144
00:07:03,015 --> 00:07:05,067
Ek saamaan par pata nahi chalta.

145
00:07:05,067 --> 00:07:07,119
Par saal bhar ka hisaab jodo,

146
00:07:07,119 --> 00:07:09,171
toh achhi khaasi rakam banti hai.

147
00:07:09,171 --> 00:07:12,250
Expense ratio bhi aisa hi hai, chhota dikhta hai,

148
00:07:12,250 --> 00:07:13,960
par har saal lagta hai.

149
00:07:13,960 --> 00:07:16,826
Aur yeh aapke poore jama paise par lagta hai,

150
00:07:16,826 --> 00:07:18,737
sirf naye 500 rupaye par nahi.

151
00:07:18,737 --> 00:07:20,648
Jaise jaise corpus bada hota hai,

152
00:07:20,648 --> 00:07:22,559
fees bhi badi hoti jaati hai.

153
00:07:22,559 --> 00:07:25,425
Corpus yaani aapka kul jama paisa, return ke saath.

154
00:07:25,425 --> 00:07:28,610
Lambe samay mein yeh chhota farq bada ban jaata hai.

155
00:07:28,610 --> 00:07:29,871
Ab kaam ki baat.

156
00:07:29,871 --> 00:07:32,708
Har fund ke direct aur regular plan hote hain.

157
00:07:32,708 --> 00:07:35,860
Regular plan mein beech mein agent ya distributor hota hai,

158
00:07:35,860 --> 00:07:37,751
uska commission bhi jud jaata hai.

159
00:07:37,751 --> 00:07:39,958
Direct plan mein yeh commission nahi hota.

160
00:07:39,958 --> 00:07:43,740
Isliye direct plan ka expense ratio aam taur par kam hota hai.

161
00:07:43,740 --> 00:07:45,678
Aur ek chhupa kharcha hai, tax.

162
00:07:45,678 --> 00:07:47,939
Equity fund saal bhar se zyaada rakha,

163
00:07:47,939 --> 00:07:50,847
toh munafe ko long term capital gain kehte hain.

164
00:07:50,847 --> 00:07:52,785
Ispe 12.5 percent tax lagta hai.

165
00:07:52,785 --> 00:07:57,630
Lekin har saal 1.25 lakh rupaye tak ka aisa munafa tax se chhoot mein hai.

166
00:07:57,630 --> 00:08:02,287
500 rupaye ki SIP waale ko yeh tax shuruaat mein shayad hi lage.

167
00:08:02,287 --> 00:08:05,153
Par jaankar rakhiye. Return dekhte waqt hamesha socho,

168
00:08:05,153 --> 00:08:08,377
kharcha aur tax ke baad haath mein kya bachega.

169
00:08:08,377 --> 00:08:11,960
Wahi asli return hai. Baaki sab screen ki chamak hai.

170
00:08:11,960 --> 00:08:14,907
Ab wapas dinner table par. Bhai ne poocha,

171
00:08:14,907 --> 00:08:17,118
toh kya FD bekaar hai? Nahi.

172
00:08:17,118 --> 00:08:20,802
Papa ki FD ki apni jagah hai. Emergency ka paisa,

173
00:08:20,802 --> 00:08:23,381
jaldi chahiye waala paisa, wahan theek hai.

174
00:08:23,381 --> 00:08:28,170
Bank deposit par 5 lakh rupaye tak ka insurance cover bhi hota hai.

175
00:08:28,170 --> 00:08:31,655
Sabse badi galti hai, darr mein faisla. Market gira,

176
00:08:31,655 --> 00:08:35,914
news mein laal screen dikhi, aur SIP band. Phir market sambhla,

177
00:08:35,914 --> 00:08:39,399
toh log upar ke daam par wapas aate hain.

178
00:08:39,399 --> 00:08:41,722
Yaani sasta chhod diya, mehnga khareeda.

179
00:08:41,722 --> 00:08:44,820
Yahi cheez SIP ko sabse zyaada bigaadti hai.

180
00:08:44,820 --> 00:08:48,742
Ek aur galti hai, sirf pichhla return dekh kar fund chunna.

181
00:08:48,742 --> 00:08:51,237
Jo fund pichhle saal sabse upar tha,

182
00:08:51,237 --> 00:08:55,159
zaroori nahi aage bhi rahe. Aur ek galti, roz app kholna.

183
00:08:55,159 --> 00:08:58,724
Roz khologe, toh roz darr lagega. SIP lambi race hai,

184
00:08:58,724 --> 00:09:00,150
roz ka score nahi.

185
00:09:00,150 --> 00:09:02,887
Toh kya karein? Pehle emergency fund, phir SIP.

186
00:09:02,887 --> 00:09:06,309
SIP utni rakho jo bure mahine mein bhi chal sake,

187
00:09:06,309 --> 00:09:08,704
chahe 500 rupaye hi kyun na ho.

188
00:09:08,704 --> 00:09:11,099
Direct plan aur expense ratio check karo.

189
00:09:11,099 --> 00:09:14,520
Aur saal mein bas kuch baar hisaab dekho, roz nahi.

190
00:09:14,520 --> 00:09:17,551
Aur jab salary badhe, toh SIP bhi thodi badhao.

191
00:09:17,551 --> 00:09:19,236
Ise step-up SIP kehte hain,

192
00:09:19,236 --> 00:09:22,604
yaani har saal SIP ki rakam badhana. Bhai ne kaha,

193
00:09:22,604 --> 00:09:24,625
theek hai bhaiya, band nahi karunga.

194
00:09:24,625 --> 00:09:28,330
Papa ne FD ki rasid rakh kar halki si muskaan di.

195
00:09:28,330 --> 00:09:29,819
Ek baat saaf kar doon.

196
00:09:29,819 --> 00:09:32,201
Main kisi fund ka naam nahi le raha,

197
00:09:32,201 --> 00:09:34,584
aur kisi return ka vaada nahi kar raha.

198
00:09:34,584 --> 00:09:36,669
Market upar bhi jaata hai, neeche bhi.

199
00:09:36,669 --> 00:09:39,349
Yeh investment advice nahi hai. Apni zaroorat dekh kar,

200
00:09:39,349 --> 00:09:40,540
samajh kar faisla kijiye.

201
00:09:40,540 --> 00:09:45,463
Agle video mein baat karenge PPF aur EPF ki,

202
00:09:45,463 --> 00:09:48,745
jo Papa ko itne pasand hain.

203
00:09:48,745 --> 00:09:53,122
Kya woh sach mein SIP se behtar hain?

204
00:09:53,122 --> 00:09:55,857
Par usse pehle aapse sawaal.

205
00:09:55,857 --> 00:10:00,780
Aapne kabhi market girne par SIP band ki hai?

206
00:10:00,780 --> 00:10:04,062
Haan ya na, comments mein likhiye.
